<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end lower ahead of long week-end.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end lower ahead of long week-end.</headline>
<text>
<p>1520 GMT - Bonos ended weaker on Thursday ahead of long week-end, pulled down by foreign markets, with the 10-year spread over Bunds almost unchanged at 63 bps vs 62 bps</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 108.44 vs 108.75, yield 6.15 vs 6.11</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 117.99 vs 118.23 at Wednesday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.25/27 vs 84.21/22</p>
